{"id":"docs_userguide_tradedata_ascot_ascot_trade","label":"Ascot Trade Type","file_type":"concept","source_file":"Docs/UserGuide/tradedata/ascot.tex","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"An Ascot's strike is not a fixed input but is derived as bondQuantity*(upfrontPayment+assetLeg-redemptionLeg)-fundingLeg, so the option payoff depends on the funding leg's valuation rather than a static number."},
