{"id":"docs_userguide_tradedata_balanceguaranteedswap_bgs_trade","label":"BalanceGuaranteedSwap (BGS) Trade Type","file_type":"concept","source_file":"Docs/UserGuide/tradedata/balanceguaranteedswap.tex","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Priced via an auxiliary Flexi Swap proxy whose amortisation lower bound assumes a MaxCPR estimated from current/historical CPR or expert judgement, giving a hypothetical but realistic hedge rather than pricing the ABS cashflows directly."},
